WEBVTT

00:01:27.095 --> 00:01:31.092
why, given the devastating impact of these diseases

00:01:31.092 --> 00:01:32.572
to the individual,

00:01:32.572 --> 00:01:35.325
never mind the scale of the societal problem,

00:01:35.325 --> 00:01:38.906
why are there no effective treatments?

00:01:38.906 --> 00:01:40.884
Now in order to consider this,

00:01:40.884 --> 00:01:43.167
I first need to give you a crash course

00:01:43.167 --> 00:01:45.492
in how the brain works.

00:01:45.492 --> 00:01:47.378
So in other words, I need to tell you

00:01:47.378 --> 00:01:49.434
everything I learned at medical school.

00:01:49.434 --> 00:01:51.474
(Laughter)

00:01:51.474 --> 00:01:53.712
But believe me, this isn't going to take very long.

00:01:53.712 --> 00:01:56.167
Okay? (Laughter)

00:01:56.167 --> 00:01:58.136
So the brain is terribly simple:

00:01:58.136 --> 00:02:01.183
it's made up of four cells,